{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-37"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-talk-403813901-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","missionId":"event-rogue-37","mission":"소원을 빌어봐","scene":"소원을 빌어봐","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"원형의 방으로 들어선 당신은 밧줄로 나뭇가지를 묶은 순백의 나무를 발견하고는 나무 전체에 서린 성결함의 미에 감탄한다. 이는 마치 춤추는 조각상과 같았다","talkId":403813901,"textHash":"565230824642576699","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:37/talk-403813901","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"10bb46b3d3c90280","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-talk-403813902-line"],"bwikiPage":"许个愿吧","bwikiRevision":59299,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8728","bwikiMission":"소원을 빌어봐"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-talk-403813902-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","missionId":"event-rogue-37","mission":"소원을 빌어봐","scene":"소원을 빌어봐","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"나무 옆에 앉아있는 여러 명의 병사들이 잠들었는지는 알 수 없다. 경건한 기사인 그들의 피부에는 혈색을 찾아볼 수 없다","talkId":403813902,"textHash":"12589389801195369224","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:37/talk-403813902","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"10bb46b3d3c90280","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-talk-403813903-line"],"bwikiPage":"许个愿吧","bwikiRevision":59299,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8728","bwikiMission":"소원을 빌어봐"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-talk-403813903-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","missionId":"event-rogue-37","mission":"소원을 빌어봐","scene":"소원을 빌어봐","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"참지 못하고 나무에 다가간 당신은 천천히 나무가 부서지는 소리를 듣는다. 뿌리 옆의 목패에 이런 문구가 적혀 있다: 「활짝… 필 수 있도록… 물을… 줘」","talkId":403813903,"textHash":"5264732415705384490","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:37/talk-403813903","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"10bb46b3d3c90280","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"许个愿吧","bwikiRevision":59299,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8728","bwikiMission":"소원을 빌어봐"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-text-17993837611761967686-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","missionId":"event-rogue-37","mission":"소원을 빌어봐","scene":"소원을 빌어봐","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"그들의 피는 거목을 소생시킬 것이니…. 전투 진입, 승리 시 ★3 축복 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"17993837611761967686","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:37/text-17993837611761967686","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6a30ad42a1cc7206","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"许个愿吧","bwikiRevision":59299,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8728","bwikiMission":"소원을 빌어봐"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-text-8389439776888507949-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","missionId":"event-rogue-37","mission":"소원을 빌어봐","scene":"소원을 빌어봐","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"★2 축복 1개 교환","talkId":null,"textHash":"8389439776888507949","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:37/text-8389439776888507949","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6abc827cac677883","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"许个愿吧","bwikiRevision":59299,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8728","bwikiMission":"소원을 빌어봐"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-text-3202456188995855770-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","missionId":"event-rogue-37","mission":"소원을 빌어봐","scene":"소원을 빌어봐","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"★3 축복 1개 교환","talkId":null,"textHash":"3202456188995855770","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:37/text-3202456188995855770","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"533dbdf23dea5754","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"许个愿吧","bwikiRevision":59299,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8728","bwikiMission":"소원을 빌어봐"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-37-text-16127782175284818846-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","missionId":"ev